// AWS AMI Shared Externally  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1537
// Detects modification of AMI permissions (ModifyImageAttribute). Sharing/making an AMI public can leak baked-in data and enable restore in…
// False positives: Deliberate AMI sharing with known accounts (allowlist).
// Source: rules/exfiltration/ec2-modify-image-attribute.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "ModifyImageAttribute" and eventSource =~ "ec2.amazonaws.com"
